# Copy to .env.local and fill in to fly over Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles
# (real 3D cities, Everest, the pyramids…). Without a key the game uses the
# free Esri World Imagery + AWS elevation globe.
#
# Get a key: Google Cloud console → enable "Map Tiles API" → Credentials →
# API key (restrict it to the Map Tiles API and your dev origin). Billing must
# be enabled on the project; there is a monthly free allowance.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
